  "content": "<p align=\"center\">\n    <a href=\"https://files.minecraftforge.net/net/minecraftforge/forge/\">\n        <img alt=\"forge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://neoforged.net/\">\n        <img alt=\"neoforge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/8494ec1ac495cfb481dc7e458356325510933eb0/assets/cozy/supported/neoforge_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://fabricmc.net/\">\n        <img alt=\"fabric\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/8Cx26tfWNs\">\n    <img alt=\"discord-singular\" width=\"148\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/flemmli97\">\n    <img alt=\"kofi-singular-alt\" width=\"140\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular-alt_vector.svg\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Flemmli97\">\n    <img alt=\"patreon-singular\" width=\"140\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_vector.svg\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\n## 🪽 TenshiLib\n\n包含共享代码的库模组，旨在为我大部分模组的开发提供帮助。\n\n仅单独安装此模组不会有任何作用。\n\n如果你是模组开发者，可以自由使用此模组，但由于它是专为我的使用场景设计的，你可能发现它没有实际用途。\n\n## 包含内容：\n\n> 动画系统，支持服务端和客户端\n\n> 基岩版模型与动画文件解析\n\n> 有向包围盒碰撞检测\n\n> 跨加载器代码与注册功能\n\n> 数学表达式解析器\n\n> 各种其他实用方法",
